<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S5.T2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Run time and plan quality comparison.<span id="S5.T2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The run time (sec.) on tree search and the generated plan quality (the required interaction steps to reach the goal) on the pointmaze environment with medium, large, and giant mazes when trained from the <em id="S5.T2.6.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">stitch</em> datasets.</span></span></figcaption>
