            <span id="alg5.l7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span> <math id="alg5.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{expandedTrees}&lt;B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>expandedTrees</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{expandedTrees}&lt;B</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l7.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
            
            
             <math id="alg5.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}\leftarrow\text{SelectOriginPosition}(\mathcal{S},G)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>SelectOriginPosition</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}\leftarrow\text{SelectOriginPosition}(\mathcal{S},G)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l8.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg5.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Tree expansion can be implemented in parallel
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg5.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
            
            
             <math id="alg5.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{p}_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}|s_{i})\propto p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}|s_{i})\exp(\mathcal{J}_{\phi}(\mathbf{x}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∝</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒥</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{p}_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}|s_{i})\propto p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}|s_{i})\exp(\mathcal{J}_{\phi}(\mathbf{x}))</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l9.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg5.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Define guided distribution
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg5.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
            
            
             <math id="alg5.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}_{i}\leftarrow\text{GrowTree}(s_{i},\tilde{p}_{\theta},D,H,L)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>GrowTree</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}_{i}\leftarrow\text{GrowTree}(s_{i},\tilde{p}_{\theta},D,H,L)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l10.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg5.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Grow tree using Online Composer
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg5.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
            
            
             <span id="alg5.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each <math id="alg5.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{j}\in\mathcal{S}\setminus\{s_{i}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{j}\in\mathcal{S}\setminus\{s_{i}\}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l11.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
            
            
               <span id="alg5.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each node <math id="alg5.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v\in\mathcal{T}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v\in\mathcal{T}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l12.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
            
            
                <span id="alg5.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg5.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\min_{p\in v.\text{plan}}\text{dist}(p,s_{j})&lt;\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>min</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mtext>plan</mtext></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mtext>dist</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\min_{p\in v.\text{plan}}\text{dist}(p,s_{j})&lt;\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l13.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
            
            
                  <math id="alg5.l14.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="G.E\leftarrow G.E\cup\{(s_{i},s_{j},v.\text{plan})\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>G</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mtext>plan</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G.E\leftarrow G.E\cup\{(s_{i},s_{j},v.\text{plan})\}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l14.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg5.l14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Add connection to graph
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg5.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
            
            
                  <span id="alg5.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">break</span>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l16.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">16:</span></span>
            
            
                <span id="alg5.l16.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg5.l16.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg5.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l17.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">17:</span></span>
            
            
               <span id="alg5.l17.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg5.l17.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg5.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l18.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">18:</span></span>
            
            
             <span id="alg5.l18.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg5.l18.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg5.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l19.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">19:</span></span>
            
            
             <math id="alg5.l19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{expandedTrees}\leftarrow\text{expandedTrees}+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>expandedTrees</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>expandedTrees</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{expandedTrees}\leftarrow\text{expandedTrees}+1</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l20.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">20:</span></span>
            
            
             <span id="alg5.l20.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> path exists from <math id="alg5.l20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{\text{start}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>start</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{\text{start}}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg5.l20.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{\text{goal}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>goal</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{\text{goal}}</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="alg5.l20.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>G</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l20.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l21.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">21:</span></span>
            
            
               <math id="alg5.l21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{path}\leftarrow\text{ShortestPath}(G,s_{\text{start}},s_{\text{goal}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>path</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>ShortestPath</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>start</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>goal</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{path}\leftarrow\text{ShortestPath}(G,s_{\text{start}},s_{\text{goal}})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l21.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg5.l21.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Dijkstra’s or A*
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg5.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l22.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">22:</span></span>
            
            
               <math id="alg5.l22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{\text{full}}\leftarrow\text{StitchPath}(\text{path})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>StitchPath</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>path</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{\text{full}}\leftarrow\text{StitchPath}(\text{path})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l22.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg5.l22.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Stitch plans along path
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg5.l23" class="ltx_listingline">
